Z||000008||mrfiero||04-21-2001||01:46 AM||||Ken,<P>I have a 4-cyl. dogbone with one good bushing and one bad.......you can put in the poly in the bad side and see what happens.<P><BR>Haze,<P>I have a dogbone from a V-6 Buick or something like that.......the bushings themselves are identical, but the dogbone is slightly longer than the Fieros.  You could probably squeeze out the bushings and reinstall onto your dogbone.<P><BR>Sorry for not getting back to you sooner......I just forgot.<P>||||reg||1
